{"id":"76bd927de48a9849","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal.md","title":"强临界序数与 Γ 枚举函数","display":"df-strongly-critical-ordinal — 强临界序数与 Γ 枚举函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","18-df-026"],"display":"df-strongly-critical-ordinal — 强临界序数与 Γ 枚举函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Equation (3.10); Lemma 3.4.12; Theorem 3.4.14","source_pages":"39–40","source_pdf_pages":"49–50","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal</span><span>18-df-026</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-critical-ordinal — 强临界序数与 Γ 枚举函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Equation (3.10); Lemma 3.4.12; Theorem 3.4.14"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"39–40"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"49–50"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span> 是可定义序数类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是可定义类函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\varphi_\\gamma(0)=\\gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SC}\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\varphi_\\gamma(0)=\\gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}(\\mathrm{SC}),\\qquad\\Gamma_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\Gamma(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}(\\mathrm{SC}),\\qquad\\Gamma_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\Gamma(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 (3.10)、Lemma 3.4.12(2) 及 Γξ:=enSC(ξ)。旧稿把 Γα 误定义为“大于 α 的下一个强临界序数”，这不是按 α 枚举 SC，尤其 Γ_{Γ₀} 不应被挤成 Γ₁。Theorem 3.4.14 的闭且无界性确保枚举在全部序数指标上存在；已读该定理的迭代构造与闭性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]"